## Lifecycle Folder Structure

```
.summaryconfig-lifecycle/
└── {summaryConfigName}/
    ├── interaction-filter.json
    ├── requirements/
    │   ├── artefacts/             ← raw inputs: emails, docs, screenshots
    │   └── final/
    │       └── requirements.md    ← BR-{ConfigName}-NNN requirements table
    ├── transcripts/
    │   ├── static/                ← bulk-fetched + enriched transcripts
    │   └── dynamic/
    ├── test-cases/
    │   └── {Category}-{Name}.json
    ├── test-sets/
    │   └── {ConfigName}-{Name}.json
    ├── version-history/
    │   └── summary-configuration-0.json  ← baseline snapshot (auto-created)
    └── eval-runs/
        └── {test-set-name}/
            └── {NNNN}/            ← zero-padded run number
                ├── _pending.json  ← run metadata + aggregate stats
                ├── {TestCaseName}.json  ← one file per test case, all transcripts inside
                └── ...
```

**`{TestCaseName}.json` structure:** `{ testCaseName, totalTranscripts, passRate, averageScore, results: [...] }` — written by `finalize_eval_run` after merging subagent outputs.

